<mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;LaminarFlow-Frontend/src/api/ping.ts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="760" y="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;export async function&lt;/font&gt; — the frontend half of GET /api/v1/ping&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;every field it hands back comes from the generated contract rather than from a hand-&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;written type, so the two ends cannot drift apart quietly&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="60" width="760" y="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Imports&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;import { &lt;a href=&quot;#func#client_ts&quot;&gt;api&lt;/a&gt; } from &#39;./client&#39;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;export async function &lt;b&gt;getPing()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="760" y="350" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Returns a Promise resolving to the parsed PingBody — { message, time, $schema? }.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;The type is never written down here: openapi-fetch narrows it out of the generated&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;paths in schema.d.ts for this exact path and method, so it is the backend&#39;s huma&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;contract that decides the shape. It never resolves to undefined — the error branch&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;throws first, so the promise rejects instead.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="100" width="760" y="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;-&amp;gt; return data&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;-&amp;gt; throw new Error(&#39;ping failed&#39;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="40" width="760" y="530" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;{&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;const { data, error } = await &lt;a href=&quot;#func#client_ts&quot;&gt;api&lt;/a&gt;.GET(&lt;a href=&quot;#func#registerPing&quot;&gt;&#39;/api/v1/ping&#39;&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;if (error) {&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;throw new Error(&#39;ping failed&#39;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;return data&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;openapi-fetch does not throw on a non-2xx — it hands back { data, error }, so this&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;branch is what stops a failed ping resolving with data left undefined&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;the path string is the link back to the backend: &lt;a href=&quot;#func#registerPing&quot;&gt;registerPing&lt;/a&gt; is what declares&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;this route and the PingBody schema both ends are typed against&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="280" width="760" y="570" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
